{"about_the_game":"<strong>Xenia</strong> is a Metroidvania that takes place in Ancient Greece and allows you to control <strong>Ardas</strong>, a blacksmith who sees his city being rushed by evil forces. <br><br>Queen Xenia is a real-life character, who lived in the 12th century b.c. Her castle was located at Ftheia plateau, Greece. According to the game\u2019s plot, the evil wizard <strong>Skotos</strong> kidnapped the queen in order to use her blood to become powerful. After the royal army was sent to Troy in aid of King Achilles, Ardas has to accomplish a very difficult task. Save the queen at any cost.<br><br>The game has been developed by only one person, Dimitris Floros, after 8 months of work. It\u2019s a side-scrolling Metroidvania style Platform in which you collect gold and use it to buy items from the Magic shop. Xenia has 12 levels, 7 bosses and makes use of secret rooms and alternate endings, which increase the game\u2019s replayability. Progress is being made by checkpoints and gameplay is fast-paced.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><br>- Metroidvania gameplay<br>- 12 stages<br>- 7 bosses<br>- Secret rooms which hide treasures<br>- Fast gameplay with checkpoints<br>- Magic shop for spending the gold you earn<br>- Alternative endings<br><br>All future updates and DLC will be provided for free. <br>For PR/Media requests send your emails to info@loresoft.gr<br>Thank you for your support!<br><br><strong><i>KEYBOARD CONTROLS<br><br>LEFT/RIGHT ARROW KEYS &gt; WALK<br>UP ARROW KEY &gt;                     JUMP<br>A KEY &gt;                                       ATTACK<br>S KEY &gt;                                       SPECIAL ATTACK<br>D KEY &gt;                                      AURA SHIELD<br>UP/DOWN ARROWS &gt;             CLIMB LADDER<br>P KEY &gt;                                       PAUSE MENU<br>C KEY &gt;                                      DELETE ALL PROGRESS<br><br><br>GAMEPAD CONTROLS<br><br>D-PAD &gt;          WALK/CLIMB<br>A KEY &gt;          JUMP<br>X KEY &gt;          ATTACK<br>B KEY &gt;          SPECIAL ATTACK<br>Y KEY &gt;          AURA SHIELD<br>START KEY &gt; PAUSE MENU<br>BACK KEY &gt;  DELETE ALL PROGRESS</i></strong>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"a29df56d4a734657e196a477d2b73a91ef356eaf.jpg","localized_name":"Gardener","name":"Gardener","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/687310/a29df56d4a734657e196a477d2b73a91ef356eaf.jpg"},{"icon":"053d8a63eda9942e797cbb2687f133822c477fe5.jpg","localized_name":"Rock them hard","name":"Rock them hard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/687310/053d8a63eda9942e797cbb2687f133822c477fe5.jpg"},{"icon":"cdadce2c68f5bb642e7fe963be33b52c0648a690.jpg","localized_name":"Burn and hammer","name":"Burn and hammer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/687310/cdadce2c68f5bb642e7fe963be33b52c0648a690.jpg"},{"icon":"9412b9b27a6c4c626c5f8dbc1fe1c1012edca0c0.jpg","localized_name":"Invincible","name":"Invincible","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/687310/9412b9b27a6c4c626c5f8dbc1fe1c1012edca0c0.jpg"},{"icon":"7093be6eaf652ab8344a3fae279f67c504a78fc5.jpg","localized_name":"Under the moon","name":"Under the moon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/687310/7093be6eaf652ab8344a3fae279f67c504a78fc5.jpg"},{"icon":"1bc921fc41af3285ac174591f890950ccbe2cdfe.jpg","localized_name":"Dragonborn","name":"Dragonborn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/687310/1bc921fc41af3285ac174591f890950ccbe2cdfe.jpg"},{"icon":"da51f5be94eac06a09340ac11f2868f83264770f.jpg","localized_name":"It's either me or you","name":"It's either me or you","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/687310/da51f5be94eac06a09340ac11f2868f83264770f.jpg"},{"icon":"5fce49db26910118037d03415de47281c2886979.jpg","localized_name":"S